# Public frontend configuration.
#
# Everything in this file is compiled into the browser bundle and is readable by
# anyone who loads the app. NO SECRET MAY EVER BE ADDED HERE — not a Shopify
# secret, Klaviyo key, Recharge token, encryption key, database URL, Redis URL,
# session secret, password, or onboarding token. Provider credentials are handled
# by the backend and never reach browser configuration.
#
# Same-origin path prefix for every API request. The Vite dev server proxies it
# to the backend and strips the prefix (/api/auth/me -> /auth/me); in production
# the same prefix is expected to be routed to the backend by the reverse proxy.
# It must be a same-origin absolute path — an absolute URL is rejected at startup.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
